# Prompt Anatomy — Project Core

- US English only for templates, docs, and UI copy.
- Stack: Pelican 4.x + custom theme at `theme/promptanatomy/`. No React SPA.
- Content in `content/`; presentation in `theme/`. Config in `data/*.yaml`, `pelicanconf.py`.
- Brand: premium AI implementation knowledge hub (calm, structured, expert)—not lifestyle or hype blog.
- Before finishing: `make validate && make build` (includes `validate_theme_tokens.py` — hex only in `tokens.css`).
- Design system v2.0: `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, `docs/design-system/`, `docs/VISUAL_QA.md`, live reference `/design-system/` after build.
- Editorial strategy: `docs/EDITORIAL_PLAN.md` — backlog, category rules, linking; `.cursor/rules/editorial-plan.mdc` for `content/articles/`.
- Agent system: `docs/AGENT_SYSTEM.md` — q-and-a-agent, editorial-agent, project skills; `make audit-content` for corpus inventory.
- Read `AGENTS.md` for workflows; **q-and-a-agent** maintains `CHANGELOG.md` and design-system documentation.
